    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Timeloop Titans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeloop Titans</strong> is a thrilling space arcade shooter that takes you into the heart of an intergalactic war! Dive into a retro-inspired adventure with modern twists as you battle endless waves of enemies determined to annihilate Planet Gaia. Do you have what it takes to save humanity?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Space Action</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of enemies in fast-paced, adrenaline-fueled gameplay.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and Power-ups</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your starship with powerful upgrades and discover rare bonuses to gain the upper hand.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Galactic Storyline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect Planet Gaia, the &quot;Sapphire of the Cosmos,&quot; and uncover its mysterious history.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way with settings for casual players or hardcore veterans.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players and claim your spot as the Galaxy's greatest pilot.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design and Graphics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired pixel art with a vibrant, modern flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning cosmic landscapes and uniquely designed ships bring the universe to life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leave Your Mark in History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of Captain Nova, humanity's last hope, and lead the charge against alien invaders. Replay levels, perfect your skills, and rise to the top of the leaderboards in this action-packed space adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Timeloop Titans</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Timeloop Titans</strong> is a thrilling space arcade shooter that takes you into the heart of an intergalactic war! Dive into a retro-inspired adventure with modern twists as you battle endless waves of enemies determined to annihilate Planet Gaia. Do you have what it takes to save humanity?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Space Action</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless waves of enemies in fast-paced, adrenaline-fueled gameplay.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades and Power-ups</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your starship with powerful upgrades and discover rare bonuses to gain the upper hand.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Galactic Storyline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect Planet Gaia, the &quot;Sapphire of the Cosmos,&quot; and uncover its mysterious history.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your way with settings for casual players or hardcore veterans.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Leaderboards</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players and claim your spot as the Galaxy's greatest pilot.</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design and Graphics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired pixel art with a vibrant, modern flair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning cosmic landscapes and uniquely designed ships bring the universe to life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Leave Your Mark in History</strong></h2><p 